      "id": "get-target-platform-manager",
      "name": "GetTargetPlatformManager",
      "category": "CoreMisc",
      "signature": "GetTargetPlatformManager(Fail On Init Errors)",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "Fail On Init Errors",
          "type": "Bool",
          "default": "true"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "ITargetPlatformManagerModule*",
      "docs": "Return the Target Platform Manager interface, if it is available, otherwise return nullptr.\n@param bFailOnInitErrors If true (default) and errors occur during init of the TPM, an error will be logged and the process may terminate, otherwise will return whether there was an error or not.\n@return The Target Platform Manager interface, if it is available, otherwise return nullptr."
